      "body": "## Summary\n\nAdd unit tests for the `purgeFromLine` function in `cmd/backup/schedule.go`.\n\n## What to test\n\nThis function parses a crontab line to extract the `--older-than` flag value from a backup purge command.\n\nTest cases:\n- Line with `--older-than 30d` — should return `\"30d\"`\n- Line with quoted value `--older-than \"30d\"` — should return `\"30d\"`\n- Line without the flag — should return empty string\n- Line with multiple flags including `--older-than`\n- Empty line\n\n## How to test\n\nPure string parsing — no file I/O or temp directories needed.\n\n## Context\n\nPart of the test coverage initiative (#241).",
