      "body": "## Summary\n\nAdd unit tests for the `fixVectorDefaultSkin` function in `cmd/upgrade/upgrade.go`.\n\n## What to test\n\nThis function checks a wiki's Vector.php settings file and inserts a `$wgDefaultSkin = 'Vector';` line if it's missing.\n\nTest cases:\n- File exists without the setting — should insert it\n- File exists with the setting already present — should be a no-op\n- File does not exist — should be a no-op\n- Dry-run mode — should report without modifying\n\n## How to test\n\nUse `t.TempDir()` to create a temporary installation directory with a settings file. No Docker or orchestrator needed.\n\n## Context\n\nPart of the test coverage initiative (#241).",
