      "body": "## Summary\n\nAdd unit tests for the `migrateDirectoryStructure` function in `cmd/upgrade/upgrade.go`.\n\n## What to test\n\nThis function migrates legacy directory layouts: renames `config/<wiki_id>/` to `config/settings/wikis/<wiki_id>/` and moves global PHP files to `config/settings/global/`.\n\nTest cases:\n- Legacy layout present — should migrate directories\n- Already-migrated layout — should be a no-op\n- Multiple wiki directories\n- Dry-run mode — should report changes without modifying anything\n- Mixed state (some wikis migrated, some not)\n\n## How to test\n\nUse `t.TempDir()` to create temporary directory structures. No Docker or orchestrator needed.\n\n## Context\n\nPart of the test coverage initiative (#241).",
