      "body": "## Summary\n\nAdd unit tests for the `extractSecretKey` function in `cmd/upgrade/upgrade.go`.\n\n## What to test\n\nThis function extracts `$wgSecretKey` from PHP settings files using regex and saves it to `.env`. If no key is found, it generates a random one.\n\nTest cases:\n- Secret key present in a PHP file — should extract and write to `.env`\n- Secret key absent — should generate a new random key\n- Multiple PHP files, key in second file\n- Dry-run mode — should report what would change without modifying files\n- `.env` already contains a secret key\n\n## How to test\n\nUse `t.TempDir()` to create a temporary installation directory with the expected structure (`config/settings/` with PHP files, `.env` file). No Docker or orchestrator needed.\n\n## Context\n\nPart of the test coverage initiative (#241).",
